      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "We sincerely apologize for the disappointing experience regarding the empty buffet and cold eggs, and we take full responsibility for failing to deliver the quality of service you deserve. Our team is immediately mobilizing to investigate the cause of the food temperature issues and to restock the breakfast area without further delay. We would appreciate a private message to your private email address to discuss how we can make this right.",
